{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Merit-Systems/x402scan/issues/1014","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Merit-Systems/x402scan","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Merit-Systems/x402scan/issues/1014/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Merit-Systems/x402scan/issues/1014/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Merit-Systems/x402scan/issues/1014/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Merit-Systems/x402scan/issues/1014","id":4811376973,"node_id":"I_kwDOP1g5L88AAAABHsfJTQ","number":1014,"title":"DISCOVERY.md documents nested x-payment-info.price shape that @agentcash/discovery rejects","user":{"login":"Echolonius","id":273862755,"node_id":"U_kgDOEFLQYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/273862755?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Echolonius","html_url":"https://github.com/Echolonius","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Echolonius/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Echolonius/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Echolonius/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Echolonius/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Echolonius/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Echolonius/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Echolonius/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Echolonius/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Echolonius/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-07-05T02:45:25Z","updated_at":"2026-07-10T05:19:22Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Summary\n\n`docs/DISCOVERY.md` tells integrators to declare pricing as a **nested object**:\n\n```json\n\"x-payment-info\": { \"protocols\": [\"x402\"], \"price\": { \"mode\": \"fixed\", \"currency\": \"USD\", \"amount\": \"0.05\" } }\n```\n\nbut the `@agentcash/discovery` validator (used by the register-origin probe and the `npx @agentcash/discovery` audit CLI) doesn't parse that shape — it reads the **flat** fields `pricingMode` / `price` / `minPrice` / `maxPrice` (see `KNOWN_PRICING_MODES` handling and `route.price` checks in the dist bundle). A spec that follows the docs exactly gets:\n\n- `[warn] L2_PRICE_MISSING_ON_PAID — Paid route ... has no price hint`\n- `[info] L2_PROTOCOLS_MISSING_ON_PAID` (whole `x-payment-info` apparently discarded on shape mismatch)\n\nwhile switching to the flat shape validates fine but then triggers `[info] L2_PAYMENT_INFO_LEGACY — One or more operations use the legacy flat x-payment-info format` — i.e. the documented shape fails and the working shape is flagged legacy.\n\n## Repro\n\n1. Serve an `openapi.json` whose paid operation uses the nested `price` object exactly as in DISCOVERY.md.\n2. `npx -y @agentcash/discovery <domain> -v` → price/protocols warnings above.\n3. Change to `{ \"protocols\": [\"x402\"], \"pricingMode\": \"fixed\", \"price\": \"0.02\", \"currency\": \"USD\" }` → validates (route shows `paid 0.02 USD [x402]`), but emits the legacy-format notice.\n\nHit this today while registering https://token-intel-x402.echolonius.deno.net (now registered successfully using the flat shape).\n\n## Suggested fix\n\nEither teach the validator the nested `price` object, or update DISCOVERY.md (and the legacy notice) to the shape the validator actually blesses — currently every by-the-book integrator lands in the same trap.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_018p8jtKC5g7uUMrjGCWksqu","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Merit-Systems/x402scan/issues/1014/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Merit-Systems/x402scan/issues/1014/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}